4.1 The policy engine decides; the founder configures
Founder sets, once, in the control plane:

Dimension	Founder-configurable
Risk thresholds	What auto-approves vs escalates
Surfaces	Which surfaces allow auto-approve at all
Agent trust tiers	Which agents get which autonomy
Duration caps	Max lease per risk class
Scope caps	What can be touched without founder
Escalation rules	What always reaches founder
Quiet hours / urgency overrides	When to interrupt vs queue
Revocation policy	Auto vs founder-confirmed
4.2 Decision matrix (example — fully configurable)
